Third-party material
--------------------

Some material in this work belongs to other people and is not covered by the
copyright above:

  - Health information is summarised from, and credited to, the organisations
    named in the app's Sources screen, including the NHS, NICE, RCOG, SACN and
    named research papers. Those organisations own their own publications.
    Facts themselves are not owned by anyone; the wording, selection and
    arrangement in this app are.
  - The app is built with open-source software, such as React and Vite, and
    uses open-licensed fonts. Each of those is used under, and remains subject
    to, its own licence, which can be found in its package.

Not medical advice
------------------

Field Notes is an independent guide. It is not a substitute for medical
advice, it has not been clinically reviewed, and it cannot check whether you
or your baby are well. Always contact your maternity unit if something feels
wrong.
